---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import matterView from '../../assets/search-matter.jpg';
---
<section class="split rv" id="search">
<div class="l"><div class="shot"><Image src={matterView} widths={[720, 1080, 1500]} sizes="(max-width: 960px) 100vw, 50vw" alt="Lucio DMS matter view: Project Lighthouse - Acquisition of Brightline Labs, with a Board Materials folder a Lister can see but must request access to" /></div><p class="small" style="margin-top:14px">Matter view. A Lister sees Board Materials exists, and must request access.</p></div>
<div class="r"><h2 class="d2">Find any document<br>by matter, client<br>or what it says.</h2><p class="lead">Type a matter number, a client or a file name, or describe what you're looking for. Lucio searches inside every document you're allowed to see and returns the current version.</p></div>
</section>
